message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "EM Waveguide & RCS Simulator: lightweight thin-film-coated materials for satellite waveguides, horns and radar cross section"
abstract: >-
  A single-file web application plus a local full-wave openEMS FDTD bridge that
  evaluates lightweight, thin-film-coated materials (flagship: MXene-coated
  basswood) as replacements for heavy solid-metal satellite waveguides, horn
  antennas and radar-cross-section (RCS) targets. It predicts a material's RF
  loss, weight and launch-to-orbit cost instantly with a validated analytical
  engine, and validates chosen designs with a real 3-D FDTD solve (openEMS).
